OL,3,GNEWSARoad safety improvements urged
OL,4,Aafter motorbike death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA coroner has urged a council to
OL,7,Fimprove the safety of a road following
OL,8,Fthe death of a 22-year-old
OL,9,Fmotorcyclist.
OL,11,FJet Thomas-Day, from Weymouth, Dorset,
OL,12,Fdied after losing control of his
OL,13,Fmotorbike on the B3390, near Crossways,
OL,14,Fon 23 August 2025.
OL,16,FAssistant coroner Richard Middleton
OL,17,Furged Dorset Council to review the
OL,18,Fspeed limit and lack of signage on that
OL,19,Fsection of road.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
