OL,3,GNEWSARoad safety improvements urged
OL,4,Aafter motorbike death
OL,5,
OL,6,FDorset Council said it had started a
OL,7,Fstudy, including a speed survey, to
OL,8,Fassess whether the limit was still
OL,9,Fappropriate and whether advisory signs
OL,10,Fwere needed for the bends.
